Connect EC2

apt update 
apt install awscli
aws --version
Check the IAM Role------aws sts get-caller-identity
Test S3 bucket access-----aws s3 ls s3://Your Bucket Name
Download the file-----aws s3 cp s3://bucket name/file name .
Read the downloaded file----cat iam-test.txt
Test Least Privilege — Delete-----------aws s3 rm s3://your bucket name/file name


json format to configure the s3 permissions
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Sid": "ListBucket",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": "s3:ListBucket",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::YOUR-BUCKET-NAME"
    },
    {
      "Sid": "ReadObjects",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": "s3:GetObject",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::YOUR-BUCKET-NAME/*"
    }
  ]
}
